{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1000_p", "source_sha256": "266d1baa549a64f9b898a7db699d288319750f148fde7bd959c57f8a8b588702", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日だ。\n着替え終わった律子が戻ってきたが……）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》的日子。\n律子换好衣服回来了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "80ce14e7b6137f805a6eb8a83a3a4204839c37cc7adc7cfb988204f3b69947af", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。\n今さらなんですが、衣装間違えたりしてませんよね？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n虽说到这时候才问……但这服装没搞错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b813b2c6264c3d5c392e29e196bbd41fb25c16d1e97e30a1fb837f8937ea8aec", "ja": "えっ？　いや、間違えてないはずだけど。\nもしかしてどこかきつかったりするか？", "zh": "诶？没有，应该没弄错吧。\n难道是有哪里觉得紧吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "06e3545f776bb3545431b3ad23b91f37cc6296ca8a0f04bd5df1fb4351a38382", "ja": "いえ、サイズは問題ないです。ただ、改めて\n見ると、結構体のラインが出る気がして……。", "zh": "不，尺寸倒没问题。只是，重新\n一看，感觉相当显身材曲线呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1004_p", "source_sha256": "424252a664bcc1ce8c95ea8c69b182205a5f3d6eb73cf1dc627b835494a3a7f5", "ja": "そりゃ、チャイナ服だしな。むしろ\nそういうところがグッとくるんだと思うけど。", "zh": "那毕竟是旗袍嘛。倒不如说，我觉得正是这种地方很吸引人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "21619042f0605c04155d6cb8368c30db5e5aad981b25756db64150164d2198a0", "ja": "一般的にはそうでしょうけど……私ですよ？\nスタイルの良い子が着るならともかく……。", "zh": "一般来说确实是这样……可穿的人是我啊？  \n要是身材好的女孩子穿倒也罢了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "2f0f8525e9a40986b386ba363adce90a1c7b203f8d261dd8cadff682868ef4c7", "ja": "あえて私にこれを選んだ理由って、なんですか？\nあれば聞かせてほしいんですけど……。", "zh": "你特意选这件给我的理由，是什么呢？\n如果有的话，希望你能告诉我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7ecf828257c24647f10c3f1a46f9081a3a0b3505b4d16772b63107f1dd6bb975", "ja": "理由……理由か。もちろんあるぞ！\nそうだな、えーっと……。", "zh": "理由……理由啊。当然有！\n让我想想，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "a24b059802a14de81775632b1725d98cb2559ff05a6b0c73a1ee4c6bc8b31523", "ja": "……もしかして、今無理やり考えてます？\nだったら……。", "zh": "……难道说，您现在是在硬想理由吗？\n要是这样的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1009_p", "source_sha256": "82985d465e62c5c79c889ff6c5dae524a512dfce10a7f6dcf91c6af055ce9645", "ja": "いや、違う違う！　そうじゃなくて、\n律子にどう伝えようか迷ってたんだよ。", "zh": "不，不是那样！倒不是这个意思，\n我只是在犹豫该怎么向律子开口。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "b4f4cb94fc9d01420da133dcdcce4a599986e045817ecd9f1d5f6a64fc2bdca0", "ja": "どう伝えようか……？\nそんなに複雑な理由があるんですか？", "zh": "该怎么说呢……？\n有那么复杂的理由吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1011_p", "source_sha256": "23c4a95431b6d5237bf406dc708a4b7d262833461c5378a45718d6921f66cb75", "ja": "さっき律子はさ、スタイルの良い子には\nそのチャイナ服が似合うだろうって言ってたよな？", "zh": "刚才律子说过，对于身材好的女孩，那身旗袍应该很合适吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "e7fce17759c2cd691d26f1d1f670c3f4975d7098d772de1b549e61367ec3a223", "ja": "ええ。実際この衣装は、女性らしさを\n表現するのにとても優秀なデザインと思いますから。", "zh": "嗯。实际上，我觉得这套服装的设计非常适合展现女性魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1013_p", "source_sha256": "866b47c78e5ebe6a56e267dc2adff2adad791605c03661366574b721968bef56", "ja": "うん、俺もそう思う。\nだからだ。だから、律子にその服を選んだんだよ。", "zh": "嗯，我也这么觉得。\n正因如此。所以我才给律子选了这套衣服啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "786b3a568037fd0e913671c82db2c4922d8ccc466672c3fe933e6d39691ed33b", "ja": "だから選んだって……それじゃあ、私の\nスタイルがいいってことですか？　ええっ！？", "zh": "你说是因为这个才选的……那就是说，我的身材很好吗？　诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1015_p", "source_sha256": "56173a991acd3c79cd667901e94264cd947085842c7e0fdb951180ac0322948e", "ja": "うん、少なくとも俺はそう思ってる。\n律子はたぶん、自分を過小評価しすぎなんだよ。", "zh": "嗯，至少我是这么认为的。\n律子你大概太低估自己了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1016_p", "source_sha256": "06aff914fc9d4ebebe7a02d12f05f427768fc9ee05657363a68a94b2f109820e", "ja": "そのチャイナ服は、律子だからこそ似合う！\nプロデューサーとして、胸を張って言える。だから……", "zh": "那身旗袍，正因为是律子才能穿得好看！\n作为制作人，我可以挺起胸膛这么说。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "34c3e1cb7fb929295d47d0146134fea700b6c14a1bdb754ac4ff3994414c9811", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっとストップ！\n面と向かって力説しないでください！", "zh": "等、等一下！\n请不要当着我的面这么用力地夸我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "87d3f063fe817ddea16e51278b1b35cc1c8bdfaf696d0d079e7e3a11b531b72f", "ja": "そんな真剣な顔で、まじまじと\n見られながら言われるのはちょっと……。", "zh": "被这样一脸认真地盯着说，实在有点……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e8d057f8d00c2d10299bdc51b17f6f0d6d70e116fb8807ce39ab2d7b3e793399", "ja": "ご、ごめん。でも本当に、律子にぴったりだと……。", "zh": "对、对不起。不过我真的觉得，这和律子太合适了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "f27b0164db916c84ebd78e00e008110c1df4f135cd487660758e40a652c62265", "ja": "ああ、もう……だから分かりましたって！\nそのお話はもうおしまい！　そろそろ本番だし……。", "zh": "啊，真是的……都说知道了嘛！\n这个话题到此为止！马上就要正式开始了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "301bbb0922e48e86a41d71c98518bc9ee835e8465ec1802fd6f86902baed8145", "ja": "撮影は全力でやってきますけど、もし文句言われたら、\n{$P$}のせいですからね！", "zh": "我会全力完成拍摄，不过要是被人抱怨了，可都是因为{$P$}哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1022_009rit", "source_sha256": "cab9e5c9af9adcd29f68007d84a72c1eb8c424e9163bc465283aea3776386840", "ja": "……ちゃんと見ててくださいよ？\n{$P$}が選んだ衣装なんですから！", "zh": "……可要好好看着哦？毕竟这是{$P$}选的服装嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0203_1023_p", "source_sha256": "fae4366a3a536ebd276d78f9b362d30bc97a745a8b00c00c68cac6c742b8d310", "ja": "（その後、紙面に載った律子のグラビアは話題を\n呼んだ。律子にこの服を選んで良かったな！）", "zh": "（之后，律子登上杂志的写真引起了热议。看来选这套衣服给她真是选对了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
